      "id": "claim_d5983d0cd20d4a43b43fbf9be8025093",
      "statement": "apps/mobile is a pnpm workspace member whose package is named `mobile` and which is still the unmodified React Native Reusables \"Minimal (Uniwind)\" starter: its README records the template init command (`npx @react-native-reusables/cli@latest init`) and app.json still carries the template identity (`name`/`slug`/`scheme` = `minimal`, version `1.0.0`), so the app has no commuter-app naming, branding or product configuration.",
