    {
      "id": "claim_385bac0145394cc4afc4a98f6f508a2d",
      "statement": "The root screen owns its own header through `Stack.Screen` options (title \"React Native Reusables\", `headerTransparent: true`, `headerRight` set to the theme toggle) instead of the layout, its only actions are two `Link asChild` buttons opening external URLs (reactnativereusables.com and the GitHub repo), and the not-found Link is the app's only internal navigation link. The header toggle calls `Uniwind.setTheme` imperatively from `onPressIn` and is the only mutation of shared state in the package; no storage dependency exists, so the app itself does not persist the choice.",
