    {
      "id": "claim_c344b8b8546f44c183c3378d58e7df99",
      "statement": "components/ui contains exactly three RN Reusables primitives that share the `cn` helper (clsx + tailwind-merge): Button (a Pressable with cva variant/size maps that publishes `buttonTextVariants` through the exported `TextClassContext.Provider`), Text (variants default/h1-h4/p/blockquote/code/lead/large/small/muted, merging the ambient context class, using `Slot` when `asChild`, and setting heading roles/aria-level), and Icon (a Lucide wrapper whose `withUniwind` mapping turns `className` into the width and color style props). The context is what lets a plain Text or Icon inside a variant-styled Button be styled without restating colours.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/mobile/components/ui/button.tsx#L106-L123",
