      "statement": "The sanctioned extension point for more UI is the RN Reusables registry: components.json configures it (style \"new-york\", baseColor \"neutral\", css global.css, `@/components`, `@/components/ui`, `@/lib`, `@/lib/utils` and `@/hooks` aliases) and the README documents `npx react-native-reusables/cli@latest add …`, including `--all`. The `@/hooks` alias currently resolves to a directory that does not exist.",
