      "statement": "The package has no state layer and no service layer: no state library is installed (no zustand, React Query, Redux or custom store), no file under apps/mobile calls `fetch`, and there is no API client, base-URL or environment read and no Supabase client reference anywhere in the package - the app never contacts apps/server, and the only app-wide state is Uniwind's theme.",
