      "statement": "The commuter-feature gap is tracked planned work rather than a defect: docs/DEVIATIONS.md section 2 (D10) lists AR wayfinding, `@rnmapbox/maps`, an `expo-sqlite` offline trace cache and MHD trust scoring as Planned / not implemented, states that apps/mobile is a template with only an unused react-native-reanimated, and notes that no server trust/GPS-trace endpoint exists either; ADR-0006 sets the commuter app's identity model (anonymous by default with optional sign-in), for which no auth code exists here - docs/SECURITY.md records that as its commuter-identity/M1 gap.",
